# Task Manager API

REST API for managing tasks.

## Technologies

- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- PostgreSQL
- Maven
- Lombok
- Validation
- Swagger / OpenAPI
- Git / GitHub

## Features

- Create task
- Get all tasks
- Get task by ID
- Update task
- Delete task
- Search tasks by status
- Search tasks by title
- Validation
- Global exception handling

## API Endpoints

- GET `/tasks`
- GET `/tasks/{id}`
- GET `/tasks/status/{status}`
- GET `/tasks/title/{title}`
- POST `/tasks`
- PUT `/tasks/{id}`
- DELETE `/tasks/{id}`

## Task Status

Available statuses:

- NEW
- IN_PROGRESS
- DONE

## Project Structure

Controller → Service → Repository → PostgreSQL

## Swagger

After starting the application, Swagger UI is available at:

`http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html`

